        "answer": {
          "short": "\\$56 940 per year.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Annual pay} &= \\text{Pay per week}\\times\\text{Number of weeks}\\\\\\text{Annual pay} &= \\$1095\\times52\\\\\\text{Annual pay} &= \\$56\\,940\\end{align*}$$",
